- fresh0 to fresh4 ended RUN OK; pods deleted and verified. Spend (launcher spend lines, recorded with `budget_v2.py --record`): fresh0 4.681, fresh1 4.648, fresh2 4.800, fresh3 4.660, fresh4 4.653 USD.
